een = new HashSet<>();\n                for (long i = l % len; i <= r % len; i = (i + 1) % len) {\n                    seen.add(full.charAt((int) i));\n                    if (i == r % len) break;\n                }\n                best = Math.min(best, seen.size());\n            }\n        }\n\n        System.out.println(best);\n    }\n\n    private static String generateBasePattern(int a) {\n        StringBuilder sb = new StringBuilder();\n        for (int i = 0; i < a; i++) {\n            sb.append((char) ('a' + i));\n        }\n        return sb.toString();\n    }\n\n    private static String repeatChar(char c, int count) {\n        return new String(new char[count]).replace('\\0', c);\n    }\n\n    private static String generateSuffix(String base, int a) {\n        boolean[] used = new boolean[26];\n        for (char c : base.toCharArray()) {\n            used[c - 'a'] = true;\n        }\n        StringBuilder sb = new StringBuilder();\n        for (int i = 0; i < a; i++) {\n            int next = 0;\n            while (used[next]) next++;\n            sb.append((char) ('a' + next));\n            used[next] = true;\n        }\n        return sb.toString();\n    }\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n#include <set>\n#include <vector>\n#include <algorithm>\n#include <climits>\n\nusing namespace std;\n\nstring generateBasePattern(int a) {\n    string sb;\n    for (int i = 0; i < a; i++) {\n        sb += char('a' + i);\n    }\n    return sb;\n}\n\nstring repeatChar(char c, int count) {\n    return string(count, c);\n}\n\nstring generateSuffix(string base, int a) {\n    vector<bool> used(26, false);\n    for (char c : base) {\n        used[c - 'a'] = true;\n    }\n    string sb;\n    for (int i = 0; i < a; i++) {\n        int next = 0;\n        while (next < 26 && used[next]) next++;\n        if (next < 26) {\n            sb += char('a' + next);\n            used[next] = true;\n        }\n    }\n    return sb;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    string line;\n    getline(cin, line);\n    \n    vector<string> tokens;\n    string token;\n    for (char c : line) {\n        if (c == ' ') {\n            if (!token.empty()) {\n                tokens.push_back(token);\n                token.clear();\n            }\n        } else {\n            token += c;\n        }\n    }\n    if (!token.empty()) {\n        tokens.push_back(token);\n    }\n    \n    int a = stoi(tokens[0]);\n    int b = stoi(tokens[1]);\n    long long l = stoll(tokens[2]);\n    long long r = stoll(tokens[3]);\n\n    if (r - l + 1 >= 2LL * (a + b)) {\n        cout << (a <= b ? a + 1 : 2 * a - b) << endl;\n        return 0;\n    }\n\n    l--;\n    r--;\n\n    int best = 26;\n\n    for (int f = 0; f < 26; f++) {\n        for (int s = a; s < 26; s++) {\n            string base = generateBasePattern(a);\n            string mid = repeatChar(char('a' + f), b);\n            string suffix = generateSuffix(base, a);\n            string tail = repeatChar(char('a' + s), b);\n            string full = base + mid + suffix + tail;\n\n            long long len = full.length();\n            set<char> seen;\n            \n            long long start = l % len;\n            long long end = r % len;\n            \n            if (start <= end) {\n                for (long long i = start; i <= end; i++) {\n                    seen.insert(full[i]);\n                }\n            } else {\n                for (long long i = start; i < len; i++) {\n                    seen.insert(full[i]);\n                }\n                for (long long i = 0; i <= end; i++) {\n                    seen.insert(full[i]);\n                }\n            }\n            \n            best = min(best, (int)seen.size());\n        }\n    }\n\n    cout << best << endl;\n    return 0;\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logpr